# Non-secret, environment-specific values the n8n host provides to workflows (read as $env.NAME).
# Base URLs, hostnames and recipient addresses belong here, never hardcoded in a workflow.
# When a workflow uses $env.NAME, document NAME in this file and set NAME on the n8n host.
# TELEGRAM_ADMIN_CHAT_ID — optional until the Telegram AI Chatbot error-handling workflow is used.
# TELEGRAM_REPLY_CHAT_ID — fallback Telegram chat for replies when the webhook body has no chat id (e.g. minimal test payload).
